{"synopsis":"Zhao Mu bertransmigrasi ke dalam tubuh seorang pewaris bangsawan yang akan menikahi seorang putri—hanya untuk diculik oleh kultivator iblis karena Tubuh Yang Murni bawaannya dan dijual ke Sekte Iblis.\nIa diselamatkan oleh seorang kakak perempuan dan mengira telah menemukan seorang dermawan, tetapi malah bencana terjadi.\n\nUntungnya, ia membangkitkan Sistem Pengembalian Sepuluh Ribu Kali Lipat. Ketika Yang Murninya diambil, sistem tersebut memberinya kompensasi berupa Tubuh Suci Yang Merah yang bahkan lebih kuat.\n\nMereka mencuri harta dan pilnya? Sistem tersebut mengembalikan sesuatu yang bahkan lebih baik.\nMengandalkan imbalan ini, Zhao Mu bangkit selangkah demi selangkah untuk menjadi jenius tertinggi umat manusia—melindungi wanita yang dicintainya dan tidak meninggalkan musuh yang hidup.","alternative_title":"万倍返还，师姐请自重","author":"卧巢, 掌阅文化","artist":"爱豆喵工作室, 爱豆喵漫画","chapters":[{"number":"32","chapter":"32","slug":"571fa025-ea69-497e-be7b-d48d4a485f26","date":"2026-08-01","images":[]},{"number":"31","chapter":"31","slug":"2aa35619-118d-45df-a50c-9cc9f145620f","date":"2026-07-25","images":[]},{"number":"30","chapter":"30","slug":"a877ec43-497c-40a6-999c-b2596e7281ea","date":"2026-07-18","images":[]},{"number":"29","chapter":"29","slug":"eb0f430e-0677-4ff0-9da4-0fb7f8dc064e","date":"2026-07-11","images":[]},{"number":"28","chapter":"28","slug":"2f93d662-cc44-4626-b38f-9efbfa3a2b10","date":"2026-07-04","images":[]},{"number":"27","chapter":"27","slug":"f96683eb-4c66-4aa3-b29c-332aa2f99e0f","date":"2026-06-27","images":[]},{"number":"26","chapter":"26","slug":"be72a51d-87cb-4c13-9796-f81fbc359ae4","date":"2026-06-20","images":[]},{"number":"25","chapter":"25","slug":"24190bad-76d8-44cc-bd97-b247a2ab05c1","date":"2026-06-13","images":[]},{"number":"24","chapter":"24","slug":"ca9d297b-2b1f-4aa2-94d0-7ed6c259f221","date":"2026-06-06","images":[]},{"number":"23","chapter":"23","slug":"fa4416df-ba5b-4d59-a128-eb7dd501de8f","date":"2026-05-30","images":[]},